[1] I'd love to tell you a short story! Once upon a time, in a small village nestled in the rolling hills of Tuscany, there was a little bakery called "Bella Vita" - Beautiful Life. The bakery was run by a kind-hearted woman named Sophia, who spent her days whipping up delicious treats like fresh bread, pastries, and cakes.

