[1] I'd love to tell you a short story! Once upon a time, in a small village nestled in the rolling hills of Tuscany, there was a little bakery called "Baci" - which means "hugs" in Italian. The bakery was owned by a kind-hearted woman named Sophia, who spent her days baking delicious treats and spreading joy to everyone who walked through her door.

